            <div class="testimonial-card featured">
                <div class="stars">
                    <i class="fas fa-star"></i>
                    <i class="fas fa-star"></i>
                    <i class="fas fa-star"></i>
                    <i class="fas fa-star"></i>
                    <i class="fas fa-star"></i>
                </div>
                <p>"Mark has been walking our energetic Lab for 6 months now. He's reliable, professional, and our dog adores him. Couldn't recommend more!"</p>
                <div class="testimonial-author">
                    <img src="/images/testimonial2.jpg" alt="Michael Smith">
                    <div>
